  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the objectified scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the objectification_scene, where the visual material of the person's body (focusing on buttocks and thighs) and the textual material ('white girls stepped their game up') combine to create a hypersexualized representation. The user is implicitly positioned as the observer or consumer of this objectification, aligning with the misogynistic intent of the meme. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the framing of the image and text creates an implicit projection of the user onto the scene as the one interpreting or reacting to the hypersexualized depiction.",
